{"id":"gezeichnet","lemma":"gezeichnet","pos":"adv","rank":4352,"glosses":["signed; usually abbreviated as gez., which see for more"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0f/De-gezeichnet2.ogg/De-gezeichnet2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hast du das gezeichnet?","en":"Did you draw that?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Habt ihr das wirklich gezeichnet?","en":"Did you really draw this?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]},{"text":"Hat er dieses Bild selbst gezeichnet?","en":"Is this a picture that he drew by himself?","words":[{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"digital photograph"},{"g":"even"},null]},{"text":"Zeig mir, was du gezeichnet hast!","en":"Show me what you drew.","words":[{"g":"to point","l":"zeigen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Ich habe das nicht gezeichnet.","en":"I didn't draw this.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}